      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95120a17c880e689f25ec8d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保科净子",
      "source_fingerprint": "898bbe6ce28253c266bc87052a2b02eb44eabbf9d2a034ca537d91f2492f5f61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "182",
        "9050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f8954eab84deb28b5cacb44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "汤华盛放",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2e5f32de1d67199658df06ca0466b0cb68a3f9e36a772aa09d436a856516ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "182",
        "9051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a1a9f621dbaef8610884e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP已经攒满啦～！不管是怎样的训练，我都会加油努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1500dcc8f2fdba339cde0011883b1a41fb309a450cc077e96af63f0fb0f3c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f652d4a0addba4ffb27d70bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……听说TP已经攒满了。……我可以先开始热身吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba22d055f1e0dca53ae11bd2732ed479c421ab4a00bc7d92d5ff6582f69c974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddd87ebbe2a8ad4676e5cfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦！呐，已经等得够久了吧？快点训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5bc7b9a33fed32e52b0df6ee070eda0f95c3dcbd35b6d5009df5114e8eb55cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842848e7af590936539ec5bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hi♪ TP似乎完全恢复了！要不要干劲十足地开始训练呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77462c114c79b325db83a141bbffb420ae5680c76794abe14a9d0a8651cb12d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8d3c21dc66b2e9d78e39d48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像完全恢复了。那么，今天我们要上演怎样的“奇迹”呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e8ac7791ec354299d0c394cf5547d0871f94d402b658cee7a703f01ccbdbd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d99c14e297aefbe634cba052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像攒满了……剩下的……嗯，直接见面聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "221ab2ce06f6b7b1d4ac94b7237f05555b4322b740c64d21dda59d5ab4b22b34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33952ec6b6508646d836fa08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Peace Peace☆ 小金船的天气预报时间到～♪\\n明天的天气是——谁知道啊。啊，听说TP全恢复了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ecb8f43a736f1db0f2131f5584b56ffb9d07e95db11da08bb40ddb6b4845022",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7e3fe24da6a5900022f73c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好嘞，TP全恢复！就算休息完我也超厉害的哦？\\n我会让你在练习时也看到我最强最帅的跑姿的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d3c651840988b65cf745b97a71b8cd81ce3e42b9b7a982cf923615c5af16b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26f2a5e7f3ebed0500767fb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了。总之我会先把一个人能做的\\n项目练了……你也要快点过来啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32cc554674f633c922d256010890b127a1fb05b2bbe550e142b0427412a0849e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5350693ccd3f16be32f69c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦！\\n训练尽管放马过来，嘿，欢迎光临！",
      "source_fingerprint": "207400bd9dd0f50b4c9b951acea4ee89537c93250587ac370701f0d4ea6864f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9805ede857b7b0c306a8966f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像已经完全恢复了。\\n能再次请您多多指导吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3dd250008ae112dc48994bf156ade7e871a2af6519efe890fc3edb244693f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549874d1986e73163d3f1898",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，训公，TP已经满了哦！\\n要训练的吧？喂，打起精神来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe2cc054149db8a2d58012d33f569407c299916901dc393191202dc8e05a671",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da7caf59d6084c1a441d4eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经全恢复了。\\n这样又能继续钻研磨炼了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c998d870b9bf165743f101fd14545d8425a29c53991c23c7849749daea61490e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282bd60ad21a2c4a02520e12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像完全恢复了哒！\\n也就是说也就是说～……进入训练时间了对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7567a010aaf9789f9280735b6af96e7fb5085537b46507ea4173462a45328b2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb4cd5ccedd2bd794bbab56",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经全部恢复了。\\n果然大家都在期待着我的表现呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5057ace0cf31416393fab1153d990407e8795146520495a219c61035ddca7087",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ef9d33e98bf1a3b08530f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了。等待到此为止。\\n……要开始了吧，训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0799e4743302466c7ab6886f1ed23cdac17117c7dfbe833ed9785cebf610816f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efe122842c70e85ca558d4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经完全恢复了。积土成山……日日的努力，\\n都会成为我们的食粮。来，让我们开始精进技艺吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e6263351910d0fd5921c49f2d6a60376e86ef64b614e9cffa8b369b70ed3683",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a3f5a18c489b28f71d46f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复了……汇报完毕。\\n我已经履行了职责，你也去完成你的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c513d44f98541194d7d2717bf0d9dcd89547a9a884a8407a74a2c3d80c62a6d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12ec460927e5033021c7c67c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦！来吧来吧，\\n到了赛马娘观察时间咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76264de891af8b2b401f1c28720b69bfabad8bb8dab96a347cbaf20948907e56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e02ec18d488a96e57551b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀？TP已经满了呢。\\n嘛，别急，慢～悠～地来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51589a849e5f821729632746def7503f329b3309c6c0aa52771bd01b22133e5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c21dfa4fcc9a1e800d71c56e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经攒满啦！不快点的话就要溢出来咯～！\\n——开玩笑的啦！好啦，我会稍微等一下的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d060d0e5940912963c6c116d295674e755866e3b8a7941760720eeb545cddb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a12c7418c224459d96fc7aab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了哦♪ 寻找四叶草\\n就到此为止，准备开始练习吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f47518d22a6d55a3ec3386d24fa907f21bed9de3f06b644b8ae03533b05a1be6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d0bb9ba285c9ea6d01218c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员君，TP好像全恢复了。虽然有点突然，\\n但我有个理论想验证一下……能帮帮我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba7aae4d4f873248b78547e1fab1c3d20f2ea665747be69d077374f85011f85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9799043ae85be2e81ddd9fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员酱☆ TP攒满啦！\\n训练结束之后要跟我多多约会哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6fddb5f67f9499566b4539c5ae5b2baf7a69afd5ade3f274d4695ba90ca0a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:848f31fe629c90dc6ef26958",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经全恢复了……\\n还有……请注意，身后……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8510c47ac04291790022f65d86d2a9941ea76b560fbb6899a11abb2e72c01c4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6e70b0e204acdc1842b26e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已完全恢复。\\nMaster，请下达下一项训练指示。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab510913f8d8bcea848510ff9c8c8da687a5e54d136ac53a75c5aad61b9d0284",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e3a2e4e1770a3e98341913",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP全恢复了！接下来要锻炼哪里？\\n腹肌？背肌？还是大腿四头肌！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8fd6b3a29c4db064cbc6f231d1f7361274d5d1fe930db84a818a31cec2bbdd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4ed1693c41d0d9907c9b7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像满了呢☆\\n为了成就全新的Buono，再次努力吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d255601eb469be067e6c4a61ffe77aa7107f2a4b4ba8f602dd4a519881eb05b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fdc9abf80764d8635910bcc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP满了哦～！\\n我正在做准备活动，请快点过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f183cde810fba4543b699094e8351823b89e4ec3ed26895af7aad6457151bda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f55a567e8d2ac4cc0c1ebe02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那、那个……听说TP攒满了……！\\n米浴……随时都可以开始训练的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea823025d83d8070254018901b40ab5e111c1db8d3e43f3924e3ab23817b5100",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b07ef6acc5539fa35ed7e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hello Hello！TP攒满啦！\\n训练的准备，我会先做好的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1629523a0d99290bf2647968b0202a6e744f94882fbfcba1def5842a7c82393f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6f014f3ba6e28a3683ddf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噢，TP好像全恢复了。那么要重新开始吗？\\n实……咳咳！是训练啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe993b6a3678d4beec5e39cd43029be355ee8b13c2cb765e56642f1535d8e702",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95951806a97b2f9238d3097f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "件名：TP已满\\n请告知训练计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09ed15fe6521268f3b5daea131877b5feffdf380027355d25fa83d87448b7a9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534d09687f6ac593fbb38b55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦！\\n让我们再次大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5edfbd28e786f9b787b5fbe8f2d7f3ed25298c8fa086106bbf21119bbdeb7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600279c399660527b5137232",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦！\\n我也精神百倍哦哦哦哦哦哦——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a422fd6f86dbf6c9983e3d7755cd4497d96d312890c62809ca1cc638c2d879",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa99105d7be0635c8d04135",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，TP攒满了哦。\\n训练必须保持最高效率吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92053da4e290bef63196631e7a9826497b96f6ec915201debbb224d53c7ac20a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cdd434a785f846dfc66b3cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP似乎已经完全恢复了。\\n是时候执行下一项计划了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "043178ba8da5218fbdde304396edda2dbf3265d079bd701b68ef8938befe8893",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e971dc655106c79b335823",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，听说TP攒满咯♪\\n所以～……来看卡莲，也是可以的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b299dde3198ceb40c8e440bb7cda54d79f376758f1fc128c6d57f7df3f593e71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7013d29ecd53faad22eafa3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经满了呢！\\n华丽的训练，这就要开始喽～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99471b0c2bc83e0888ca31b26af04ad96c44ac9d0b3fa152c78d569737937cba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:059926359f2bb695a95cfa53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽说TP已经全恢复了……\\n不过，我这边热身都已经做完了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ae92aa2ec22fddb85a28f4b7e9ca294e4b3412321099f72b304e9482b4a08b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd113e953e58c194123500da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复！也就是说……嗯？那个……。\\n可以进行大量爆进了呢！是的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43561722d21c4b411d7b71c19263750db584a1258fcf6d2ff3a8cac20e52403",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c5d319d623b5b8ce8b81fc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hey！TP已经满了哦！\\n今天也要积极地进行训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4ee1f389ac1fcfad41bfad5304ef034cf552a0dca51cfe936575df047f5842d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a031991433588ec83bce02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP满了哦！不快点过来的话～……\\n我就要疯狂恶作剧咯——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66cedb14e064ee0ebe4390738ac5807407905c772f3ebe680e5d94adc345456",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df8c929ecc46f886772b3ada",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经满了呢！魔法的修行，\\n赶紧开始吧！喂，快点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f195978abec7bfe2501d0d6aa9f001c48b12f4b9daa1d4576d5825bc26a1f374",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f276800e9a13adb239464a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经攒满了～！乖乖等在那里的\\n训练员，要给你「乖乖」奖励哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "613e9d5b0494489b5cdeae70de6138d464c7a46a222c46d96929a0217aff556d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac8cac06e537936418935d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像攒满了！\\n无论是课程还是训练，尽管放马过来吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b3d9d5f6d29c8e31afe609060f5dd58c80c0c04794af49383baa96ca810848",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b19b3429a27ac4ae9de49dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『宿于英雄体内的力量·TP已充盈。她决定在训练开始前\\n等待伙伴（第3卷第27页）』",
      "source_fingerprint": "9659d18346f8975fabf45883b9a0648ec7921d75665a03909909caa84e9788a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe1997039a454e80ccec564e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP到MAX了哦。\\n美甲也干透了，随时都可以开始～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c093b6a60e0e5b77a8c794d2a9dbe6185c9bee5c5b9b556cc8481b3fa11b0e7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43df6cc752a9b259e1cf413",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已满……正是时候。\\n过来吧，如果你已经做好觉悟的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab118a0b3cc1f04e1e60ef5d8de10758fd1f5e4ea3687231064ce655ad930446",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b646e7c9fd63e45813197f85",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复了……总之，我只是来知会一声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61852343fcdec28890fe01ca556f1fdf30b2b6e3a61adf9bf7dda84875daedc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7002a033a2b3fd23c6586670",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个，TP已经满了。\\n训练准备已经做好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9943cdc7e49372378c9bed4978ed27f7364094dddce7cce1abf2002bdef77b1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16c9ddc976d98f803001763",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐呐！听说TP已经满了哦！！\\n呐！TP是什么呀——！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf888bd892491d319819f9f8342a8b86a1fc7032d9d9ed706aab9fa9547298f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572cd9db9b75e4797e613a36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！！TP已经MAX了！！\\n可不能输给对手啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49adf5e01ee7b41cdd51f6e20a2ab53c4f343a0e950f6bc311a8a2ff422caf6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e99f114181c458cf40e2709e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噢噢～！TP能量充满！！\\n随时可以出动参加训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44984141432aecc95fa31729c7c11e187cc229aab139f23037ce18f933cdacf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335e474e283e8330af5849bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看卡看！TP攒满了哦☆\\nMarvelous要开始了★ 那么，走起吧☆★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db45c818af389a04101023a88d7e3ca61b9d902488acd5aaeb3629dcccd562e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f353485ca3d8792f5a95be47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "梦、梦中白兴大人对我说『TP已全恢复』……！\\n这是不是意味着训练运也是大吉……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abeee096e168a0a0d3a365c6d070da1988b3fa5bed6f6fa207fcff21ca540dc7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9ced4b1ab6220168fb5aaa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像攒满了。\\n我会先练着的，你随时过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328e0805c9432006d4c7e792fef126db5ab417f3b6f56f3995c5f827b3d5e351",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65314eed629c2cdfbab785b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复了～。如果努力训练的话……\\n我也能得到救赎，对吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e870f132836fed99d10ca53f0f57237744b1a4f8fc971bfb6a42d54b9ed6ada",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d08139590db23f5bf88073",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP攒满了。\\n……准备已经做好了，随时可以叫我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80bb4c6c0cd91e6cc280ff6086fb6f58e0d0bb38684e1f3bc7933ba5de11c75e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc71956887f60cecedabfb4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP全恢复了哦～。托您的福，\\n身体也休息好了……差不多该开始练习了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e2c4ab6f48315a37563b752f0e6cdcb88187e53dc0102ffe783ff087fd389f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9312e198dd9905faae055e75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了。之后就看你的了。\\n要如何培育一流的赛马娘，计划定好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac6b541daeb9bed46bd3084d54eff1eb355a8b136d3c31c0713423a1eae333c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ce43fb0d22d567085a1efa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦～！\\n为了训练，嘿、嘿、哞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4703d2a113c39ee217d8fcca4444375259b70f919ec1864f741414f2d7d8dee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4829cc90b37bf21e6bced29e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经恢复。我已经做好了准备，\\n只要训练员一到就可以开始训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c0392a26ca96e698d8da0c10e576758caceafef47b375250a3a7519c612533",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37340a12c2acf97a99513497",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已满，准备就绪！\\n剩下的就只等你了呢！",
